<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-19T04:59:02.653Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Kenyan-led multinational forces continue fighting gangs in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff while Erik Prince's Blackwater contractors use drones and air support to strike gang positions. Sri Lankan police STF and army contingents have been deployed to Haiti, joining a Bangladesh advance team for the UN security mission, and 500 Sri Lankan soldiers were sent to reinforce the GSF. The United Nations renewed sanctions on Haiti and allocated US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. A secret arms deal links Haitian police to Dolly Parton’s nephew, a former lawmaker, with millions missing. 193 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168598&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOZ2c0Uk1WaGQtMlNSQU5BRWpJZlk3aGtWQTRSTW5jZU5kQUNhNlRaVVBsbjA5OFExRkppb21VVE0zUEdtd1FtZ2l2eXp4clNxUTFDV0xYM05hVHVRM0VqQXdodjJnZU9uQThRR0cwemlPNUpkXzBHS1ZwWmZBWGsyRFZTVDVaa01ySGQxVWdGbk9uZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE42VmZnYzJEU2hkWTF4ekZSaW5LN2NPbFJyVHIyMFdBZ1JEVEdHUFQweXAxVjJfOXNPRFRRLXQySzlxcmpfaGI5VXBwU1dOMzE2TmxUVXlaRC1QSUdxTG01TjBjLV8zbGlIdjROMW5kSWl0YkN4Rndj?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQeGNmQk4tcHJJbnd6aHdoSm5MQks2QXV2d2lKdW5aUFdiUW1YYjloZlhwWWFaM2Z4TFQ3RHctRUxkRlctbC1HUjQzT2pFZXZuM2JaR3NkdlRSYjlGaFdjcjdBVmNBc0xaTEliQ2tEOC12WURsdk9CMkc1ZDVSZkZtT0xZWFhlUEZUQkIyMVVfVW8wUjN2bFh5cS1NRWZYV2FMV08wSmVKM0I4QUZ5cmIzZ2hNdzNWV2dvNjBZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Small Wars Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQcHFLRDFiNUFaTlhWTTdicjRpMGdSQjl6YndxczhqaDA1d0NrNDdzeU9XNFUxQjd1VzZUVTYwc2ZOekRsN016cDZKdVNJckdI